      "note": "RODECaster Duo datasheet (downloaded, read as text): 2 x combo jack (mic, instrument, line), 1 x 3.5 mm TRRS headset jack (I/O), two balanced 1/4 in line outputs, two high-power headphone outputs plus the TRRS headset output, USB interface 1 and 2 (USB-C), Ethernet, microSD, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi; power USB-C PD (so no mains inlet and no power control). The datasheet does not state the connector size of the two headphone outputs: 3.5 mm is assumed for this small unit, so beta-modelled. Size 235 x 225 x 76 mm, 1.131 kg (datasheet). TRRS headset not modelled. Slab profile is an estimate: the sources give only the outer sizes (rear height at the io edge, a lower front lip); the real desk is not a straight wedge. Positions guesses; headphones on the front lip."
